        "summary": "L&L Hawaiian style macaroni salad. Simple comfort food, and pairs well with Chicken Katsu.",
        "instructions": "<ol> <li><strong>Boil the macaroni: </strong> <p>Bring a large pot of water to a boil. Once boiling, generously salt the water. Add in the pasta and cook to al dente, according to package directions. Drain the pasta, rinsing with cold water, and set aside</p></li> <li><strong>Assemble the macaroni salad:</strong><p>Add cooled elbows to a large mixing bowl with the rest of the ingredients. Season with kosher salt and ground black pepper, as desired. Stir to combine, seasoning with additional spices and/or salt as needed.</p></li> <li><strong>Serve immediately or refrigerate then serve.</strong></li></ol>",
